        <body>
            <div xml:id="d679">

                <pb facs="0948" n="824" xml:id="pg824"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.51/290: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Salvador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schwyler</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Salvador</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-08-29T13:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 29,
                                1923—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 8:22 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>50. National Assembly this morning approved all pending loan decrees with only
                    one dissenting vote.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schuyler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
